{"title": "Quasit", "pageid": 18140, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Quasit", "categories": ["Non-playable races", "Fiends"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Quasit_Familiar_Portrait.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/1/19/Quasit_Familiar_Portrait.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"149\" height=\"155\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Quasit_Familiar_Portrait.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Quasits</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/Fiend#Demon\" title=\"Fiend\">demons</a> similar to <a href=\"/wiki/Imp\" title=\"Imp\">imps</a>. One of their kind can be summoned on the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Prime_Material_plane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Material Plane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Prime_Material_plane\">Material Plane</a></span> using  <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Quasit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/38px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/50px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Quasit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Quasit\">Find Familiar: Quasit</a> or a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit\" title=\"Scroll of Summon Quasit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit\" title=\"Scroll of Summon Quasit\">Scroll of Summon Quasit</a>.\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-de